Notepad++ for macOS
===================

This project is a macOS port of Notepad++ and is therefore a derivative work of
it. It is distributed under the GNU General Public License version 3 or later —
see LICENSE.

Notepad++
  Copyright (C) Don HO <don.h@free.fr> and contributors
  https://github.com/notepad-plus-plus/notepad-plus-plus
  GPL-3.0-or-later

  This port reuses Notepad++'s data files verbatim at build time — langs.model.xml,
  stylers.model.xml, the 23 themes, the functionList parser rules, the API files for
  auto-completion, the user-defined language samples and the 94 nativeLang
  translations — and ports the logic of its language/lexer wiring and its editor,
  search and encoding commands. None of Notepad++'s Win32 UI code is used.

